:: Underground city - escaped slave [Place bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">UNDERGROUND CITY</h1>
<br />
<<newgirl>>
<<set $tmpGirl.relationship = 0>>
<<set $tmpGirl.happy = random(5, 20)>>
<center>
    <<image 'places/underground/underground_escaped_slave.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
You were cutting through one of the service corridors behind the main hall when you saw her — pressed into a gap between two rusted storage units, knees drawn up, watching the passage entrance. A collar around her throat. She spotted you a half-second after you spotted her.
<br /><br />
She didn't run. Just went very still.
<br /><br />
<<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
    I'm not going back.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />
She said it quietly. Not a plea. A statement.
<br /><br />
You didn't move. She read something in that and her jaw tightened.
<br /><br />
<<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
    Two years. Two years I worked for him. Did everything right. And then he just —
<</sayNpc>>
<br />
She stopped. Looked at the floor for a moment, then back at you.
<br /><br />
<<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
    I'm not going back. Whatever you do to me out here, it's better than that place. I mean it.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />
She held your gaze when she said it. Not begging. Daring you to make it worse than what she left.
<br /><br />
<<set _canCapture = $player.energy >= 20 && $slaves.length < $basementLimit>>
<<set _canInvite = ($game.location.guesthouse ?? false) && $guests.length < $guesthouseLimit>>
<div id="es_capture">
<<if _canCapture>>
<<linkreplace 'Capture her'>>
    <<run $('#es_invite').hide()>>
    <<run $('#es_return').hide()>>
    <<run $('#es_leave').hide()>>
    She saw it in your face before you moved. Didn't fight — maybe she'd known this was how it was going to go. You hauled her up by the arm and she came with you, quiet the whole way.
    <br /><br />
    <<set $tmpGirl.capture = false>>
    <<energy -20>>
    <<run $slaves.push($tmpGirl)>>
    <<statsAdd 'people_captured'>>
    <br />
    <<link 'Head home'>>
        <<goto 'Underground city'>>
    <</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
<</if>>
</div>
<div id="es_invite">
<<if _canInvite>>
<<linkreplace 'Offer her a place to stay'>>
    <<run $('#es_capture').hide()>>
    <<run $('#es_return').hide()>>
    <<run $('#es_leave').hide()>>
    She studied your face like she was looking for the part where it turned into something worse. You waited.
    <br /><br />
    <<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
        You're serious.
    <</sayNpc>>
    <br />
    Not a question. She grabbed the collar and pulled it off over her head in one motion, let it drop.
    <br /><br />
    <<set $tmpGirl.capture = false>>
    <<set $tmpGirl.relationship = Math.min(($tmpGirl.relationship ?? 0) + 30, 100)>>
    <<set $tmpGirl.happy = Math.min(($tmpGirl.happy ?? 0) + 40, 100)>>
    <<run $guests.push($tmpGirl)>>
    <br />
    <<link 'Head home'>>
        <<goto 'Underground city'>>
    <</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
<</if>>
</div>
<div id="es_return">
<<linkreplace 'Find her master'>>
    <<run $('#es_capture').hide()>>
    <<run $('#es_invite').hide()>>
    <<run $('#es_leave').hide()>>
    She grabbed your arm when she realized where you were going. You shook her off.
    <br /><br />
    <<goto 'Underground city - escaped slave - master'>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="es_leave">
<<link 'Leave her be'>>
    <<goto 'Underground city'>>
<</link>>
</div>
